To run the Pr you will need:

Node.js	24.10
TypeScript	5.8

Nest.js	11.1(or higher)
Prisma	6.7.0(or higher)

First clone the repository:

    git clone git@github.com:Chromamouse/About-Me.git

Next, prepare environment variable file by copying .env.dist to .env:

    cd nestjs-project-boilerplate
    cp .env.dist .env


Use docker to set up the environment:

    docker compose up -d --build

And the project should be running. You can check the logs by entering:

    docker compose logs -f app
